    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/3b99b5550244e8f8b71f73517df4fd63.poster.avif?t=1741300911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/3b99b5550244e8f8b71f73517df4fd63.webm?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/3b99b5550244e8f8b71f73517df4fd63.mp4?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Monday Meltdown is a <strong>super fast paced</strong> 2D top-down <strong>multiplayer</strong> shooter for up to 8 players, made to <strong>dunk </strong>on your friends - or foes.<br>Unlock taunts such as &quot;sit lol&quot; and skins and more to showcase your dominance in<strong> quick showdown matches</strong> in various gamemodes and maps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/04daf791e7d2decdd5124843b61f690d.avif?t=1741300911\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/426dddc74cf578bb72d998ab77132472.poster.avif?t=1741300911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/426dddc74cf578bb72d998ab77132472.webm?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/426dddc74cf578bb72d998ab77132472.mp4?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MAYHEM</strong></h2></li></ul>Engage in thrilling <strong>short</strong> multiplayer <strong>rounds</strong> where you face off against friends or foes in <strong>intense</strong> combat.<br>Challenge your skills, strategy, and reflexes as you strive to outsmart and outgun your opponents in a variety of gamemodes! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/29f6f22cc2ec5be59c2facb5c15fa74b.avif?t=1741300911\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1c7634a6897f410ebe19dea049186092.poster.avif?t=1741300911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1c7634a6897f410ebe19dea049186092.webm?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1c7634a6897f410ebe19dea049186092.mp4?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARSENAL OF DESTRUCTION</strong></h2></li></ul>Equip yourself with a wide range of <strong>weapons</strong> that cater to every mood of Monday rage. From rapid-fire <strong>SMGs</strong> to devastating <strong>shotguns</strong> and brutal <strong>melee</strong> implements, pick your weapon of choice and outplay your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/a3f4e7c619d12651eb0560762fc72f21.avif?t=1741300911\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/d7c381de6a15b9f0446eb538e8eca076.poster.avif?t=1741300911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/d7c381de6a15b9f0446eb538e8eca076.webm?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/d7c381de6a15b9f0446eb538e8eca076.mp4?t=1741300911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN DAY AT THE OFFICE?</strong></h2></li></ul>Settle workplace disputes in a whole new way! Picture everyone in familiar spots trying to <strong>outsmart </strong>each other. The office, gym, and grocery store become arenas for settling scores. Monday Meltdown transforms boring locations into <strong>battlefields </strong>where every corner hides a surprise. Get ready to navigate chaos and settle disputes with a bloody blast!<br><br><strong>Are your ready to melt some Mondays?</strong>",
